Package: vabaxos-help
Architecture: all
Maintainer: VabaxOS <https://github.com/Vabax-dev/VabaxOS>
Section: doc
Priority: optional
Recommends: firefox-esr | www-browser
Description: VabaxOS help, the user guides in the system
 The VabaxOS user guides as accessible web pages, readable offline: boot
 menu, welcome, voice, first setup, desktop, Start menu, reader,
 installation and updates. "VabaxOS help" in the Start menu opens them.
